{"articleNo":"241631","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=241631&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2020 ASEAN Youth Career Mentorship Program 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.09.02","hit":"7043","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 일시 및 장소 </strong></strong>:&nbsp;2020.9.26.(토) 11:00-12:00, 당 센터 아세안홀(유튜브와 줌(Zoom)을 통한 온라인 참석)</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 참석 대상 </strong></strong>: 국내 거주 아세안 국가 유학생</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 행사 내용 </strong></strong>: △국내 기업 채용 전략, △한국 취업 비자 정보, △아세안 출신 국내 기존&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">취업자들과의 대화 등</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 공동 주최 </strong></strong>: 주한아세안유학생회(ASEAN Youth Network in Korea, AYNK)</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 프로그램 신청 </strong></strong>:</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/102r5S80XAkzfDWWW_dn2t65ZUsfVvGMDhY_luRXmLOc/viewform?edit_requested=true\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/102r5S80XAkzfDWWW_dn2t65ZUsfVvGMDhY_luRXmLOc/viewform?edit_requested=true\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/102r5S80XAkzfDWWW_dn2t65ZUsfVvGMDhY_luRXmLOc/viewform?edit_requested=true</font></u></a></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><strong><strong>ㅇ 문의처</strong> : <u>이상희 과장</u>&nbsp;(02-6387-8001 또는 <a>shtinalee@gmail.com</a> / <a href=\"mailto:koreaafa@naver.com\">koreaafa@naver.com</a>)</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoQTnAHAPATgVQMoEkAuBZAjge